ubmed so  please check that out  and that is going to be  it  for today from biology professor so  thank you guys very much for tuning in  let me know if you're using google  scholar let me know if it's helpful and  if you have any questions  put that in the comment box and don't  forget to subscribe  so you can  learn about more cool topics thanks for  watching bye

